WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:09.570
what do you do on the days when you're
just not feeling it those days those

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:21.869
days when I'm tired or worn out or just
basically sick of the grind well what do

00:00:21.869 --> 00:00:32.460
I do on those days I go anyways I get it
done even if I'm just going through the

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:41.690
motions I go through the motions I don't
really want to work out I work out I

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:49.500
really don't want a hammer on a project
I hammer on the project don't really

00:00:49.500 --> 00:01:01.129
want to get up and get out of bed yeah I
get up and get out of bed now these

00:01:01.129 --> 00:01:06.119
could be signals that you need some time
off

00:01:06.119 --> 00:01:15.060
and those signals might be right they
could be correct but don't take today

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:19.590
off
not today wait until tomorrow don't

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:25.740
don't give in to the immediate
gratification that is whispering in your

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:36.090
ear shut that down do not listen to that
little voice instead go through the

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:40.979
motions
lift the weights sprint the hill work on

00:01:40.979 --> 00:01:49.740
the project get out of bed now as an
overall rule I do not like

00:01:49.740 --> 00:02:02.130
procrastination you need to get things
done but if you are going to rest that

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:06.750
is one thing that you should
procrastinate on that's the one thing I

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:12.860
want you to put off until tomorrow and
if when tomorrow comes

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:21.600
you still feel like you need to rest or
you need to take a break then okay take

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:30.150
it but the chances are you won't you
won't need that rest chances are you

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:37.020
will realize that the desire to rest was
just weakness it was just the desire to

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:45.470
take the path of least resistance that
downhill path the easy path and by

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:50.000
simply going through the motions you

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:56.940
overcame that path and you stayed on the
righteous path the discipline path there

00:02:56.940 --> 00:03:08.540
stayed on the war path which is right
where you know but you belong

